Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 18)
Maintainer: Michael Mainguy <michael@mainguy.com>
Description: Yamaha MOTIF ES Owner's Manual MCP Server
 TypeScript + Express server exposing the Yamaha MOTIF ES Owner's Manual
 via Model Context Protocol with hybrid semantic and keyword search
 (SQLite FTS5 + sqlite-vec).
